WEBVTT

01:30.870 --> 01:34.950
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.020 --> 01:37.960
[Episode 6]

01:38.430 --> 01:38.990
Your Highness.

01:38.990 --> 01:40.039
The Junior Khan
of western Mongolia is here.

01:40.039 --> 01:41.080
Let him in.

01:58.680 --> 02:02.030
[The Junior Khan of western Mongolia]

02:01.150 --> 02:02.010
Your Highness.

02:02.740 --> 02:03.350
My Lady.

02:08.630 --> 02:09.650
You used guns

02:09.680 --> 02:11.400
to kill so many of my brothers.

02:11.630 --> 02:13.230
How dare you still come here?

02:16.010 --> 02:16.870
Your Highness.

02:18.550 --> 02:20.620
You are the master of Horqin land.

02:21.150 --> 02:21.870
My father

02:23.920 --> 02:26.650
owns half of the grasslands
in western Mongolia.

02:27.560 --> 02:30.220
He sent me to talk with you,

02:31.430 --> 02:33.230
hoping we can resolve this issue

02:33.950 --> 02:35.890
without bloodshed.

02:36.630 --> 02:37.880
What do you want?

02:38.280 --> 02:41.030
The Qing emperor is finished.

02:41.610 --> 02:43.430
They can barely help themselves.

02:43.430 --> 02:44.960
This is a good opportunity.

02:45.120 --> 02:47.120
Someone is willing to help us

02:47.320 --> 02:49.120
break away from the Qing Empire.

02:50.680 --> 02:52.190
When we marched, my father said

02:52.190 --> 02:53.560
if you agree, Your Highness,

02:53.560 --> 02:55.360
we will cease fire immediately.

03:17.150 --> 03:19.140
In the days of Genghis Khan,

03:19.620 --> 03:21.460
brothers never

03:21.750 --> 03:23.350
spilled each other's blood.

03:24.730 --> 03:26.790
Nor did they conspire with outsiders

03:26.960 --> 03:28.290
to attack their own kin.

03:30.280 --> 03:32.320
Back then, at the meeting at Dolon Nor,

03:32.320 --> 03:33.660
your father and I

03:33.840 --> 03:35.860
swore an oath to the Eternal Heaven

03:36.800 --> 03:38.540
that those within and beyond the pass

03:38.540 --> 03:39.810
would be as one family

03:40.000 --> 03:42.140
and never betray the imperial court.

03:43.310 --> 03:43.930
I…

03:44.960 --> 03:46.200
will not go with you!

04:02.360 --> 04:03.530
Uncle Jelme.

04:04.240 --> 04:05.100
How about this?

04:05.520 --> 04:06.590
I will give you

04:06.630 --> 04:07.710
half of my guns.

04:08.710 --> 04:09.970
We march west together

04:10.390 --> 04:11.790
to seize more grasslands

04:12.360 --> 04:14.350
and reclaim all the tribes there.

04:14.750 --> 04:16.209
It is a good deal.

04:19.350 --> 04:21.250
I want nothing from you.

04:22.450 --> 04:23.560
I won't kill you.

04:24.850 --> 04:25.730
Leave now!

04:33.570 --> 04:34.430
Your Highness.

04:37.300 --> 04:38.100
It seems...

04:40.070 --> 04:41.159
you truly know nothing

04:41.159 --> 04:42.370
about guns.

04:42.940 --> 04:43.680
Guns

04:44.000 --> 04:45.000
come in all sizes.

04:45.420 --> 04:46.830
When I came in just now,

04:47.390 --> 04:48.890
your men searched me

04:48.950 --> 04:49.710
thoroughly.

04:51.950 --> 04:52.720
But they have

04:53.159 --> 04:54.750
never seen a real gun.

04:54.750 --> 04:55.610
Your Highness.

05:01.260 --> 05:02.950
Is this your idea of benevolence?

05:02.950 --> 05:03.730
I hope

05:04.560 --> 05:05.910
you will be wise.

05:06.260 --> 05:07.120
Your Highness,

05:07.350 --> 05:08.690
don't agree to his terms.

05:08.690 --> 05:09.620
Don't be afraid.

05:12.120 --> 05:13.350
Of course.

05:13.960 --> 05:15.750
If I agreed,

05:16.390 --> 05:18.730
even the lambs on the grasslands

05:18.760 --> 05:19.890
would curse my name.

05:20.230 --> 05:21.630
If I agreed,

05:21.930 --> 05:23.030
the Eternal Heaven

05:23.230 --> 05:25.080
would reject my soul!

05:26.240 --> 05:26.770
Shoot!

05:26.800 --> 05:27.270
Your Highness.

05:27.270 --> 05:29.400
What's so great about the Qing Empire?

05:30.240 --> 05:31.840
If you remain this stubborn,

05:31.980 --> 05:34.040
don't blame me for what happens next.

05:34.950 --> 05:36.730
You two could die here today,

05:36.750 --> 05:38.010
and no one would know.

05:43.680 --> 05:44.659
Someone knows.

05:47.630 --> 05:48.690
Good girl.

05:49.630 --> 05:50.710
Kill him!

05:52.000 --> 05:52.940
Little girl,

05:53.630 --> 05:54.390
this knife

05:55.190 --> 05:56.800
is fine for cutting cheese.

05:57.680 --> 05:59.680
But if you can't kill me with one cut,

06:00.550 --> 06:02.210
you'll be the one who suffers.

06:04.580 --> 06:05.310
Listen to me.

06:06.700 --> 06:08.430
In the pocket of my leather coat,

06:08.430 --> 06:10.030
there is a pouch of fine gems.

06:10.480 --> 06:12.140
I swear to the Eternal Heaven,

06:12.680 --> 06:14.680
every one of them is worth a fortune.

06:16.540 --> 06:17.590
Take them.

06:18.480 --> 06:19.480
Leave this place.

06:20.670 --> 06:21.930
Whatever happens here

06:22.100 --> 06:23.560
has nothing to do with you.

06:49.250 --> 06:50.220
Bastard!

06:57.800 --> 06:58.659
Your Highness.

07:04.830 --> 07:05.600
Eat up. Go on.

07:05.800 --> 07:06.730
It tastes great.

07:08.680 --> 07:10.280
You think you deserve to eat?

07:15.010 --> 07:15.820
Heizi.

07:17.360 --> 07:19.920
Sing us a song to kill the boredom.

07:22.070 --> 07:22.870
Alright!

07:24.490 --> 07:25.160
Eat up.

07:25.180 --> 07:25.870
Eat up.

07:26.920 --> 07:31.060
The red sun lights up the dam.

07:31.160 --> 07:33.190
Wind and sand lift the red bridal veil.

07:33.190 --> 07:35.050
I'd feed the dog before I feed you!

07:36.680 --> 07:40.350
My girl sways in the sedan chair.

07:40.740 --> 07:41.360
Here, eat.

07:41.390 --> 07:44.120
I raise my head from below the chair.

07:44.140 --> 07:44.800
Take a bite.

07:46.090 --> 07:49.480
-I mean it this time.
-Wine scent fills the room as I look back.

07:49.480 --> 07:52.409
-The wind blows the candle out again.
-You want meat?

07:53.360 --> 07:54.390
Do you even have any meat?

07:54.390 --> 07:58.120
When I see my girl,

07:58.190 --> 08:01.630
I just wave my hand.

08:19.870 --> 08:21.100
Send it out.

08:21.260 --> 08:22.450
Look at your hand.

08:22.800 --> 08:23.600
Lower it down.

08:24.120 --> 08:25.050
Turn around.

08:25.120 --> 08:26.250
Yes, just like that.

08:26.390 --> 08:28.050
Press down lower.

08:28.130 --> 08:29.240
Look at it.

08:29.800 --> 08:31.470
Be graceful.

08:32.390 --> 08:33.270
Good.

08:34.080 --> 08:35.130
Walk.

08:43.030 --> 08:43.840
Thank you.

08:44.910 --> 08:46.550
Thank you for saving me, madam.

08:46.550 --> 08:47.790
I need to go to Horqin,

08:48.440 --> 08:49.570
where the battle is.

08:51.440 --> 08:52.700
You're already there.

08:57.910 --> 08:59.280
This girl

09:00.320 --> 09:02.200
is my daughter now.

09:03.240 --> 09:04.570
Do you want to marry her?

09:05.480 --> 09:06.520
His Highness said

09:07.440 --> 09:09.240
we'll withdraw our troops today

09:09.640 --> 09:11.370
and hold the wedding ceremony.

09:14.790 --> 09:15.270
I...

09:24.650 --> 09:25.900
Just heal up nicely.

09:26.840 --> 09:28.150
Watch your neck.

09:32.960 --> 09:34.550
What is going on here?

09:44.320 --> 09:46.050
His Highness is back!

09:46.550 --> 09:47.360
His Highness…

09:47.390 --> 09:49.200
His Highness is back!

09:49.200 --> 09:51.550
His Highness is back!

09:51.960 --> 09:53.200
His Highness is back!

09:53.200 --> 09:54.520
His Highness is back!

09:56.270 --> 09:57.590
His Highness is back!

09:57.670 --> 09:58.840
His Highness is back!

09:58.840 --> 09:59.720
His Highness is back!

09:59.720 --> 10:00.620
His Highness is back!

10:00.620 --> 10:01.440
His Highness is back!

10:01.440 --> 10:02.640
His Highness is back!

10:04.720 --> 10:05.910
The princess
and her consort have returned.

10:05.910 --> 10:07.620
Which one of you is Mr. Chang?

10:09.200 --> 10:10.330
What are you saying?

10:10.630 --> 10:12.120
The princess
and her consort have returned.

10:12.120 --> 10:13.720
Which one of you is Mr. Chang?

10:21.810 --> 10:24.530
At one year old, it is tethered.

10:24.590 --> 10:27.260
At two years old, it gallops freely.

10:27.290 --> 10:30.080
In a gathering as vast as the sea,

10:30.150 --> 10:32.780
it takes first place time and again.

10:32.800 --> 10:35.710
It comes from a fertile homeland.

10:35.750 --> 10:38.390
It drinks from the western springs.

10:38.480 --> 10:41.170
The herd rushes like white waves.

10:41.200 --> 10:43.890
Mares give birth to new foals.

10:57.000 --> 10:57.600
Mr. Chang.

10:57.960 --> 10:59.290
Stop staring. Drink up.

11:00.360 --> 11:01.000
Mr. Gu,

11:01.840 --> 11:02.900
how did my daughter

11:02.960 --> 11:04.580
become a princess?

11:04.630 --> 11:06.080
What on earth happened?

11:06.960 --> 11:07.750
Don't ask me.

11:07.790 --> 11:08.790
I'm confused too.

11:09.000 --> 11:11.210
It drinks from the western springs.

11:11.240 --> 11:13.000
The herd rushes like white waves.

11:13.000 --> 11:15.780
Mares give birth to new foals.

11:15.840 --> 11:18.580
At one year old, it is tethered.

11:18.630 --> 11:20.600
At two years old, it gallops freely.

11:20.600 --> 11:22.600
It takes first place time and again.

11:34.360 --> 11:35.320
This time,

11:35.670 --> 11:37.670
the enemy retreated without a fight.

11:37.670 --> 11:39.360
We're drinking this cup

11:39.840 --> 11:41.980
not because we won.

11:43.390 --> 11:46.740
From Ujimqin to the Great Wall,

11:47.120 --> 11:48.600
we are all one family.

11:49.440 --> 11:51.360
Fighting between brothers

11:51.750 --> 11:52.880
is nothing serious.

11:53.080 --> 11:54.000
But now,

11:54.670 --> 11:57.670
some people have charged in with guns.

11:58.480 --> 12:00.880
The grasslands will no longer be peaceful.

12:00.960 --> 12:02.510
The world is falling into chaos.

12:02.510 --> 12:03.910
I have resolved

12:04.790 --> 12:06.600
never to bow to the enemy.

12:08.240 --> 12:10.800
If you stand with me,

12:11.120 --> 12:13.370
drink this wine!

12:18.360 --> 12:20.200
Cheers!

12:26.600 --> 12:28.580
From this day on, the Horqin tribe

12:28.960 --> 12:30.790
has a new princess.

12:31.240 --> 12:32.550
Princess!

12:32.630 --> 12:33.960
Princess!

12:33.980 --> 12:36.080
Princess! Princess!

12:37.870 --> 12:39.840
You have all seen the princess.

12:40.360 --> 12:42.480
But you haven't met her consort.

12:43.750 --> 12:45.050
I'll have him come out

12:45.210 --> 12:46.930
to drink with everyone.

12:46.960 --> 12:49.340
Yes! Yes!

12:50.080 --> 12:51.630
Consort!

12:51.750 --> 12:53.410
Consort!

12:53.550 --> 12:55.200
Consort!

12:55.320 --> 12:56.870
Consort!

12:56.960 --> 12:58.290
Consort!

12:58.320 --> 12:59.870
Consort!

13:01.240 --> 13:02.100
Your Highness.

13:05.080 --> 13:06.500
The princess's consort

13:06.870 --> 13:08.080
has brought us

13:08.480 --> 13:10.540
the medicine we desperately needed.

13:10.870 --> 13:13.700
That bastard Hanlong

13:14.150 --> 13:15.680
nearly ruined everything.

13:15.960 --> 13:18.870
This young man here
has done a great service.

13:19.270 --> 13:20.550
So I am happy

13:20.910 --> 13:23.410
to marry the princess to him.

13:24.240 --> 13:25.000
Consort.

13:26.600 --> 13:29.000
What reward do you desire?

13:29.750 --> 13:30.480
Land?

13:31.390 --> 13:32.110
Herdsmen?

13:33.000 --> 13:34.720
Or to be a great general

13:35.480 --> 13:37.080
and lead troops into battle?

13:40.150 --> 13:41.010
Your Highness.

13:42.080 --> 13:43.120
I have a request.

13:49.120 --> 13:50.390
Those captured with me,

13:50.390 --> 13:51.920
the herdsmen and captives—

13:52.480 --> 13:53.680
they are Mongols too.

13:55.080 --> 13:56.930
I heard that after capture,

13:56.950 --> 13:58.210
they'll be made slaves

13:58.600 --> 14:00.330
and live worse than livestock.

14:00.670 --> 14:02.470
I want to ask you to give the order

14:02.910 --> 14:04.040
to set them all free.

14:07.200 --> 14:08.080
Then,

14:08.480 --> 14:10.360
I gift them all to you as slaves.

14:10.430 --> 14:11.360
-Great!
-Great!

14:12.150 --> 14:13.600
Slaves!

14:13.790 --> 14:15.150
Slaves!

14:18.790 --> 14:20.250
I have been a slave myself.

14:21.390 --> 14:22.240
I know the feeling.

14:22.240 --> 14:23.240
It is unbearable.

14:24.090 --> 14:25.030
So I do not want anyone

14:25.030 --> 14:25.900
to be my slave.

14:27.910 --> 14:28.970
What I mean is...

14:31.360 --> 14:34.090
Please, Your Highness,
give them their freedom.

14:35.550 --> 14:36.650
Are you

14:37.480 --> 14:39.970
trying to change my rules?

14:43.000 --> 14:44.200
As you said yourself,

14:44.750 --> 14:46.040
the world is in chaos.

14:46.270 --> 14:47.800
There is no peace anywhere.

14:48.270 --> 14:49.120
Why can't those old rules

14:49.120 --> 14:50.080
be changed?

14:51.670 --> 14:52.930
If Your Highness can

14:52.960 --> 14:55.120
show kindness
to the herdsmen from other tribes,

14:55.120 --> 14:55.920
in the future,

14:56.630 --> 14:58.000
when resisting foreign enemies,

14:58.000 --> 14:59.550
you may find more allies.

15:00.150 --> 15:01.880
Please consider it carefully.

15:12.320 --> 15:13.960
Without captives as slaves,

15:14.390 --> 15:16.050
how shall I reward those

15:16.150 --> 15:17.810
who distinguish themselves?

15:20.550 --> 15:21.930
Who do you think you are

15:23.480 --> 15:25.480
to dare break my rules?

15:35.670 --> 15:36.470
Open the door!

15:44.940 --> 15:46.710
By order of the Horqin Consort,

15:46.930 --> 15:48.630
all prisoners shall be released!

15:48.630 --> 15:50.480
Those with homes may return.

15:50.630 --> 15:51.960
Those with nowhere to go

15:52.080 --> 15:53.200
may stay in the tribe.

15:53.200 --> 15:54.440
You will be given weapons,

15:54.440 --> 15:55.300
cattle, sheep,

15:55.360 --> 15:56.120
and tents.

16:01.510 --> 16:02.110
You may go.

16:32.560 --> 16:33.590
Everyone says

16:33.720 --> 16:35.050
my consort

16:35.080 --> 16:37.000
is as merciful as a god.

16:37.120 --> 16:38.080
He released so many

16:38.080 --> 16:39.200
captives and slaves.

16:39.200 --> 16:41.000
You really should go out and see.

16:47.270 --> 16:48.080
However,

16:49.390 --> 16:51.120
I never expected you to say that

16:51.150 --> 16:52.160
back there.

16:52.550 --> 16:53.790
Even Her Highness said

16:53.790 --> 16:54.630
it's the first time she's seen

16:54.630 --> 16:56.720
someone contradict His Highness like that.

16:56.720 --> 16:58.030
You're really something.

16:58.030 --> 16:59.450
I just spoke my mind.

16:59.510 --> 17:00.270
So what?

17:01.120 --> 17:03.430
Worst case, he'd chop off my head

17:03.670 --> 17:05.609
and find you a new consort.

17:06.240 --> 17:07.880
Who wants that?

17:08.589 --> 17:09.680
His Highness said

17:10.400 --> 17:11.920
if you stay here,

17:12.550 --> 17:13.750
he will keep you safe.

17:15.310 --> 17:15.920
I...

17:16.480 --> 17:17.589
I can stay too.

17:22.640 --> 17:24.170
If not for you, Chang Yu'er,

17:25.599 --> 17:27.530
I'd be dead ten times over.

17:30.830 --> 17:32.150
If I were a free man,

17:33.830 --> 17:35.630
I'd stay here on the grasslands.

17:36.400 --> 17:37.640
Riding horses and herding sheep

17:37.640 --> 17:38.480
every day.

17:39.550 --> 17:40.610
That would be nice.

17:43.640 --> 17:45.000
But I'm not.

17:47.480 --> 17:49.030
What's the big deal?

17:49.070 --> 17:50.830
First time seeing you like this.

17:50.830 --> 17:52.630
You're not even afraid of death,

17:52.680 --> 17:54.680
yet you're beating around the bush.

17:54.680 --> 17:56.140
It's just exile, isn't it?

17:57.310 --> 17:59.110
The imperial court hasn't caught you.

17:59.110 --> 18:00.480
Let's say...

18:01.480 --> 18:02.550
Let's say...

18:03.880 --> 18:04.960
I caught you.

18:06.400 --> 18:07.590
You, the princess,

18:08.640 --> 18:09.770
are a real princess.

18:11.790 --> 18:13.200
But I, the consort,

18:14.550 --> 18:15.750
am a fake.

18:21.640 --> 18:22.970
I am engaged back home.

18:33.240 --> 18:33.750
You…

18:36.160 --> 18:37.680
You never mentioned that.

18:41.680 --> 18:42.570
Before,

18:43.710 --> 18:45.320
I told you about my father.

18:46.160 --> 18:47.790
We were very poor then.

18:48.400 --> 18:49.800
Couldn't afford school.

18:50.310 --> 18:51.750
The village schoolteacher,

18:51.750 --> 18:52.800
Mr. Bai,

18:52.830 --> 18:53.790
took pity on me

18:53.960 --> 18:56.440
and taught me to read for free.

18:57.550 --> 18:58.960
He had a daughter

19:00.070 --> 19:01.000
named Bai Yimei.

19:01.200 --> 19:03.030
Before I went to the capital for exams,

19:03.030 --> 19:04.690
we exchanged betrothal gifts

19:04.920 --> 19:06.580
and were officially engaged.

19:07.750 --> 19:09.480
I planned that after the exams,

19:09.920 --> 19:11.320
I'd go back and marry her.

19:15.240 --> 19:16.200
So...

19:18.110 --> 19:19.240
so where is she now?

19:21.210 --> 19:21.790
Now?

19:25.030 --> 19:25.760
I don't know.

19:27.720 --> 19:28.520
I have no idea.

19:43.680 --> 19:44.840
Anyway,

19:45.590 --> 19:46.400
I think

19:47.160 --> 19:48.020
since we have

19:48.590 --> 19:50.070
faced death together,

19:53.160 --> 19:54.480
I owe you the truth.

19:57.790 --> 19:59.130
I am an exile,

20:00.200 --> 20:01.270
and I am engaged.

20:02.170 --> 20:03.370
I'm not worthy of you.

20:19.000 --> 20:19.960
I think...

20:23.720 --> 20:25.580
I've really had too much to drink.

20:27.350 --> 20:28.750
Wearing this outfit...

20:30.270 --> 20:31.600
made me forget reality.

20:32.200 --> 20:35.260
This whole thing
about the princess and her consort...

20:36.350 --> 20:37.610
was just play-acting.

21:31.000 --> 21:31.860
Your Highness.

21:32.310 --> 21:33.400
Don't walk further.

21:33.400 --> 21:34.420
Alright.

21:37.960 --> 21:38.920
Get up, sweetie.

21:52.270 --> 21:53.130
Your Highness.

21:54.240 --> 21:55.830
I am so fond of this girl.

22:00.640 --> 22:02.880
You don't care for gold or jewels,

22:03.440 --> 22:05.640
so I'm giving you this jade pendant.

22:06.640 --> 22:07.960
If one day

22:08.270 --> 22:09.350
you are in trouble,

22:09.790 --> 22:10.520
send someone

22:10.530 --> 22:12.060
to bring this pendant to me.

22:12.300 --> 22:13.580
No matter how far,

22:13.790 --> 22:16.630
Horqin warriors will come

22:17.640 --> 22:18.970
to solve your problems.

22:20.330 --> 22:22.380
Especially the problem next to you.

22:26.240 --> 22:27.560
I can see that this guy

22:28.510 --> 22:30.350
doesn't truly want to marry you.

22:32.000 --> 22:33.330
I don't want him anyway.

22:33.450 --> 22:35.380
You really won't stay?

22:35.920 --> 22:39.080
No matter what mistake you made,

22:39.920 --> 22:41.240
I'd protect you.

22:44.000 --> 22:45.930
Thank you for your great kindness.

22:46.440 --> 22:48.190
But I miss my home dearly.

22:48.720 --> 22:50.250
My elderly mother is there.

22:50.440 --> 22:51.570
I cannot travel far.

22:53.000 --> 22:54.330
The matter with Hanlong

22:54.590 --> 22:55.930
has been taken care of.

22:56.790 --> 22:58.070
You suffered a great injustice

22:58.070 --> 22:59.670
during your visit this time.

23:00.200 --> 23:01.270
Thank you, Your Highness.

23:01.270 --> 23:03.150
Thank you for your hospitality.

23:03.590 --> 23:04.720
We shall meet again.

23:04.720 --> 23:05.240
Good.

23:05.590 --> 23:06.720
Until we meet again.

23:07.590 --> 23:08.160
Please.

23:20.720 --> 23:21.350
Take care.

23:21.550 --> 23:22.680
Take care, sweetie.

23:23.440 --> 23:24.570
Take care, sweetie.

23:29.030 --> 23:29.960
Let's depart.

23:43.320 --> 23:46.540
[Li Wantang's Mansion in the capital]

23:45.510 --> 23:47.160
Here are the land deeds

23:47.350 --> 23:48.610
and the reserve funds.

23:49.270 --> 23:50.800
Keep the silver cash on you.

23:51.240 --> 23:53.900
You'll manage
the Pingyao draft bank yourself.

23:54.200 --> 23:55.530
Don't worry about that.

23:55.640 --> 23:56.840
The banking business

23:57.000 --> 23:58.730
relies on financial strength.

23:58.830 --> 24:00.400
Surely the Li family's wealth

24:00.400 --> 24:01.750
can match theirs.

24:01.830 --> 24:03.560
It'd be ridiculous otherwise.

24:04.030 --> 24:05.090
You can't say that.

24:05.270 --> 24:06.390
In business,

24:06.480 --> 24:09.400
unity is the most important thing.

24:10.590 --> 24:12.070
I hear the Shanxi merchants

24:12.070 --> 24:13.330
are extremely united.

24:14.070 --> 24:15.200
That's crucial.

24:17.440 --> 24:18.030
Master.

24:18.480 --> 24:19.540
There is something

24:19.830 --> 24:21.530
I don't know if I should say.

24:22.070 --> 24:22.600
Go ahead.

24:24.750 --> 24:26.170
Some in the family say

24:26.440 --> 24:27.830
investing so much

24:28.030 --> 24:29.990
to open a draft bank in Shanxi

24:30.270 --> 24:32.280
might not be worth the risk.

24:36.640 --> 24:37.740
Is it written that

24:37.830 --> 24:39.160
only Shanxi people

24:39.200 --> 24:40.930
are allowed to run draft banks?

24:43.030 --> 24:44.830
That is exactly what I told them.

24:44.830 --> 24:45.750
I'm just worried that you are

24:45.750 --> 24:47.880
getting too close to the southerners.

24:48.310 --> 24:49.970
Is it too risky?

24:50.350 --> 24:51.370
I have my plans.

24:56.750 --> 24:57.210
Father.

24:57.640 --> 24:59.040
I've packed everything.

24:59.070 --> 24:59.790
Good.

25:00.640 --> 25:01.900
Before you go,

25:02.200 --> 25:03.880
I have a few words for you.

25:04.960 --> 25:06.160
I'm all ears.

25:08.440 --> 25:10.000
This is our first time

25:10.030 --> 25:11.640
entering the lion's den in Shanxi

25:11.640 --> 25:12.920
to compete for our share.

25:12.920 --> 25:13.960
Who knows how many people

25:13.960 --> 25:15.420
are waiting to see us fail.

25:15.720 --> 25:17.120
Do not be careless.

25:18.030 --> 25:19.400
Yes. I certainly won't

25:19.440 --> 25:21.040
disgrace the Li family name.

25:23.200 --> 25:24.710
What name do we have?

25:25.480 --> 25:27.120
Business is like war.

25:27.270 --> 25:29.200
You just have to fight a few battles.

25:29.200 --> 25:31.460
Don't be arrogant because of our wealth.

25:32.070 --> 25:34.670
And don't secretly look down on others.

25:35.070 --> 25:37.130
That's a land full of rich merchants.

25:37.310 --> 25:39.710
Learn and ask questions
when you get there.

25:40.160 --> 25:40.680
Sure.

25:41.160 --> 25:42.700
Pawnshops and banks

25:42.960 --> 25:44.960
run on a cycle of inflow and outflow.

25:45.680 --> 25:47.520
Money shouldn't flow too fast,

25:47.920 --> 25:49.520
nor too slow.

25:50.270 --> 25:51.830
The stakes involved...

25:56.550 --> 25:57.160
Enough.

25:57.790 --> 25:58.720
When you do it yourself there,

25:58.720 --> 25:59.920
you will understand.

26:00.790 --> 26:02.150
I'm telling you now.

26:02.440 --> 26:04.400
You are the vanguard this time.

26:04.830 --> 26:06.390
If you fail, I will step in.

26:06.510 --> 26:07.890
But don't blame me then

26:08.160 --> 26:09.360
if I show you no mercy.

26:10.480 --> 26:11.720
Understood!

26:16.220 --> 26:20.900
[Shanxi]

26:40.110 --> 26:41.640
You have to leave after all.

26:42.590 --> 26:43.450
I'm a fugitive.

26:43.510 --> 26:45.370
I have no right to say such things.

26:45.400 --> 26:46.620
Don't overthink it.

26:47.240 --> 26:49.240
Go back and take care of your father.

26:54.000 --> 26:54.460
Will...

26:58.030 --> 26:58.920
Will you...

27:00.640 --> 27:02.000
w-will you come see me?

27:02.830 --> 27:03.850
I mean...

27:04.720 --> 27:06.280
after you marry Miss Bai.

27:11.720 --> 27:12.480
I hope so.

27:14.440 --> 27:15.270
I have an elderly mother

27:15.270 --> 27:16.400
and a younger brother at home.

27:16.400 --> 27:17.440
Often in my dreams,

27:17.440 --> 27:18.300
I think of them.

27:19.200 --> 27:21.200
I've burdened them all these years.

27:21.960 --> 27:23.030
If my family

27:24.000 --> 27:25.660
suffers any more misfortune,

27:26.350 --> 27:27.400
I don't know if Heaven

27:27.400 --> 27:28.600
will ever forgive me.

27:30.720 --> 27:32.320
You haven't wronged anyone.

27:33.160 --> 27:34.050
Take care.

27:49.510 --> 27:50.720
Fugitive Gu Pingyuan!

27:50.720 --> 27:52.110
Dismount and surrender!

27:52.110 --> 27:53.680
Chang Si is to be arrested as well.

27:53.680 --> 27:54.790
Harboring a fugitive

27:54.790 --> 27:56.250
carries the same penalty!

27:56.720 --> 27:57.980
Fugitive Gu Pingyuan!

27:58.000 --> 27:59.400
Dismount and surrender!

27:59.400 --> 28:00.920
Chang Si is to be arrested as well.

28:00.920 --> 28:02.030
Harboring a fugitive

28:02.030 --> 28:03.490
carries the same penalty!

28:28.030 --> 28:28.590
Master,

28:28.750 --> 28:30.480
the county magistrate is here.

28:32.680 --> 28:34.080
Let me ask you something.

28:34.640 --> 28:36.710
These pawnshop accounts...

28:36.920 --> 28:39.200
How were they kept?

28:39.550 --> 28:40.350
Who kept them?

28:41.160 --> 28:42.880
They rushed to finish them
before the Spring Festival.

28:42.880 --> 28:45.610
The head and second managers
have reviewed them.

28:48.920 --> 28:50.270
So small?

28:51.270 --> 28:52.550
So thin?

28:53.000 --> 28:56.480
The pawnshop accounts
for the past five years

28:56.550 --> 28:58.790
are getting increasingly simplified.

29:01.440 --> 29:03.040
Do they

29:03.680 --> 29:05.400
have no respect for me?

29:07.270 --> 29:09.130
The two managers are getting old.

29:09.200 --> 29:11.140
They lack energy.

29:11.270 --> 29:12.720
Is it a lack of energy?

29:13.960 --> 29:14.830
I think they just

29:14.830 --> 29:17.160
don't respect me!

29:21.440 --> 29:22.720
Isn't it just because

29:23.680 --> 29:26.010
I have no son?

29:27.110 --> 29:29.110
Because I have no heir?

29:36.250 --> 29:38.070
[Magistrate of Pingyao]

29:42.180 --> 29:45.590
[Auspicious Clouds]

29:42.660 --> 29:45.000
I've been waiting for you for ages.

29:45.960 --> 29:47.560
Your Worship, you're here.

29:47.680 --> 29:49.480
Forgive me for not greeting you sooner.

29:49.480 --> 29:50.480
What happened

29:50.720 --> 29:52.960
with Chang Si caused quite a stir.

29:53.310 --> 29:54.510
I can't suppress it anymore.

29:54.510 --> 29:56.660
I can't explain it to my superiors.

29:57.960 --> 29:59.690
Who do you need to explain it to?

30:00.750 --> 30:02.880
The prefecture has its governor;
the circuit has its intendant.

30:02.880 --> 30:05.570
A lowly seventh-rank official like me

30:05.720 --> 30:07.440
has to report to them.

30:07.960 --> 30:08.720
Besides,

30:09.960 --> 30:12.190
the convict with Chang Si

30:12.790 --> 30:14.080
is an exile

30:14.240 --> 30:16.460
who escaped from Ningguta.

30:16.880 --> 30:19.000
Handing him over

30:19.160 --> 30:21.200
would earn us major credit.

30:22.550 --> 30:24.640
They've even sent a guerrilla general

30:24.640 --> 30:26.040
with troops to catch him.

30:26.170 --> 30:28.630
You want me to cover this up now,

30:28.650 --> 30:30.790
but I don't have that kind of power.

30:31.310 --> 30:31.900
I can't do it.

30:31.900 --> 30:33.900
You have to show me a way out.

30:38.240 --> 30:40.550
I heard that convict

30:40.570 --> 30:41.790
is quite capable.

30:44.110 --> 30:47.020
When Chang Si went beyond the pass
to buy salt,

30:47.110 --> 30:48.070
it was because of

30:48.070 --> 30:49.440
his help

30:49.440 --> 30:50.920
that the deal succeeded.

30:51.680 --> 30:53.410
And on the Horqin Grasslands,

30:53.550 --> 30:55.540
this guy helped him again.

30:56.590 --> 30:58.570
Surrounded by troops,

30:59.030 --> 31:01.490
he charged straight into
the prince's tent.

31:01.960 --> 31:02.830
Interesting.

31:03.440 --> 31:04.580
Very interesting.

31:05.550 --> 31:06.680
Soon

31:06.750 --> 31:07.890
it will be time

31:08.200 --> 31:10.550
for officials' performance reviews.

31:10.680 --> 31:12.840
I want to move up the ladder.

31:14.200 --> 31:15.630
I need achievements.

31:16.830 --> 31:19.630
We've been looking out
for each other these years.

31:21.440 --> 31:22.680
Do me a favor

31:22.720 --> 31:24.580
and give me this credit, will you?

31:42.000 --> 31:43.660
I've been looking out for you.

31:44.270 --> 31:46.400
Not the other way around.

31:48.550 --> 31:51.950
You spent six years
awaiting appointment as the magistrate.

31:52.310 --> 31:54.170
Who paid for

31:54.200 --> 31:55.860
this official's hat of yours?

31:56.240 --> 31:57.960
With such meager achievements,

31:57.960 --> 31:59.690
you think you'll get promoted?

32:00.000 --> 32:02.540
Dream on!

32:13.160 --> 32:14.690
I'll help you one more time.

32:16.350 --> 32:17.130
You

32:17.590 --> 32:19.750
go tell the governor

32:20.110 --> 32:22.270
that man isn't an exile.

32:22.310 --> 32:23.310
That you made a mistake

32:23.310 --> 32:25.070
and the case is under investigation.

32:25.070 --> 32:26.830
I'll go see that guerrilla general

32:26.830 --> 32:28.550
and bribe him.

32:28.680 --> 32:30.340
He won't give you any trouble.

32:32.550 --> 32:33.290
Thank you.

32:47.160 --> 32:49.380
I really don't understand.

32:50.270 --> 32:52.370
Who did this despicable thing?

32:53.350 --> 32:54.480
It was Wang Tiangui.

32:55.110 --> 32:56.960
He won't rest until you're dead.

32:59.400 --> 33:00.530
You think it was him?

33:03.350 --> 33:04.610
You paid him back,

33:05.110 --> 33:06.630
so his plan failed.

33:07.480 --> 33:09.010
He's been holding a grudge.

33:09.400 --> 33:10.930
He needed to vent his anger.

33:12.200 --> 33:13.350
This is my fault.

33:13.680 --> 33:14.880
I didn't think ahead.

33:15.920 --> 33:18.320
I dragged you into this, Mr. Gu.

33:18.550 --> 33:19.270
Mr. Chang,

33:20.070 --> 33:20.960
don't say that.

33:22.110 --> 33:24.030
We're friends through thick and thin.

33:24.030 --> 33:26.090
I'm the one who's caused you trouble.

33:26.350 --> 33:28.670
It's just a house.

33:28.880 --> 33:29.830
Even if you gave it to him,

33:29.830 --> 33:31.560
what difference would it make?

33:31.720 --> 33:32.920
With people like him,

33:33.350 --> 33:34.270
the more you give in,

33:34.270 --> 33:35.640
the more they take.

33:37.240 --> 33:39.170
Since we've already offended him,

33:39.880 --> 33:41.480
let's just see what happens.

33:51.720 --> 33:53.320
Come out for interrogation!

34:20.760 --> 34:22.420
You're something else, brat.

34:23.440 --> 34:25.560
Wearing fifty catties of shackles,

34:25.840 --> 34:27.280
and not a scratch.

34:29.030 --> 34:30.560
You're a seasoned convict?

34:30.960 --> 34:32.020
You could say that.

34:32.840 --> 34:34.710
I wore shackles just as heavy back then

34:34.710 --> 34:36.639
and walked all the way to Ningguta.

34:36.710 --> 34:37.880
If I hadn't learned

34:37.880 --> 34:39.800
how to wrap my ankles from the old-timers,

34:39.800 --> 34:41.730
I probably couldn't even walk now.

34:44.190 --> 34:47.650
The imperial court has sentenced you
to immediate execution.

34:48.190 --> 34:49.550
Brat,

34:49.590 --> 34:51.380
you won't suffer much longer.

34:57.230 --> 34:59.390
Harboring a criminal

34:59.590 --> 35:01.230
is also a capital offense.

35:02.230 --> 35:04.560
It's fine if you die,

35:04.590 --> 35:07.190
but you've dragged
someone else down with you.

35:07.610 --> 35:09.450
I think before autumn comes,

35:09.670 --> 35:11.350
I'll be congratulating you.

35:18.480 --> 35:19.280
Convict,

35:20.360 --> 35:21.320
are you asleep?

35:22.150 --> 35:23.160
Cut the crap.

35:24.190 --> 35:25.190
Someone like you

35:25.800 --> 35:27.760
wouldn't look like a prince
even in royal robes.

35:27.760 --> 35:29.440
Trying to play the magistrate?

35:29.440 --> 35:31.040
Go study for a few more years.

35:32.440 --> 35:34.100
Shut your mouth!

35:35.960 --> 35:37.360
I'm the one

35:37.400 --> 35:39.070
living comfortably here.

35:39.110 --> 35:41.030
You are the one about to die!

35:41.960 --> 35:42.630
Do you still think

35:42.630 --> 35:44.060
you're a scholar?

35:44.230 --> 35:46.190
Your title has been stripped.

35:46.320 --> 35:47.150
I'm basically

35:47.190 --> 35:48.960
looking at a dead man now.

35:49.000 --> 35:50.930
Then why waste breath on a dead man?

35:57.380 --> 35:58.170
Speak.

35:59.360 --> 36:01.020
Apart from Mr. Chang's house,

36:01.800 --> 36:03.000
what else do you want?

36:17.190 --> 36:18.430
What do you want?

36:19.800 --> 36:20.850
Can I trust you?

36:23.540 --> 36:24.110
You

36:24.110 --> 36:25.440
don't know me very well.

36:25.630 --> 36:26.880
We businessmen

36:26.880 --> 36:28.800
value credibility above all.

36:29.110 --> 36:30.470
Although business

36:30.630 --> 36:32.880
involves many schemes,

36:32.920 --> 36:34.180
the worst thing

36:34.510 --> 36:36.270
is breaking one's word.

36:37.480 --> 36:38.000
Fine.

36:39.710 --> 36:41.140
I want Mr. Chang

36:41.480 --> 36:42.610
and his family safe.

36:43.790 --> 36:44.880
Name your terms.

36:51.190 --> 36:52.510
I heard

36:52.880 --> 36:54.400
that in Ningguta

36:54.440 --> 36:56.100
and on the Horqin Grasslands,

36:56.110 --> 36:57.070
you made that old fool

36:57.070 --> 36:58.630
a lot of money.

37:00.590 --> 37:03.290
Can you help me too?

37:13.840 --> 37:15.940
Do you know the pawn business?

37:20.160 --> 37:24.050
[Taiyufeng Pawnshop]

37:20.280 --> 37:22.880
My ancestors left me a pawnshop

37:23.760 --> 37:26.520
that I've expanded considerably.

37:27.590 --> 37:29.070
Anhui people are the best

37:29.150 --> 37:30.650
at running pawnshops.

37:30.710 --> 37:32.740
Anhui merchants are hardworking

37:33.110 --> 37:34.240
and have a sharp eye.

37:34.360 --> 37:35.550
Record this!

37:35.710 --> 37:37.680
One bright red wedding dress,

37:37.710 --> 37:39.030
collar worn,

37:39.070 --> 37:40.480
moth-eaten, and rat-chewed.

37:40.480 --> 37:42.410
Stained all over, no accessories.

37:42.480 --> 37:44.340
Pawn value: four maces of silver.

37:52.440 --> 37:54.300
Head Manager, please take a look.

37:54.600 --> 37:57.100
[Head Manager of Taiyufeng]

37:54.760 --> 37:55.670
The head manager

37:55.670 --> 37:57.100
appraises antiques and jewelry.

37:57.100 --> 37:59.240
[Second Manager of Taiyufeng]

37:57.280 --> 37:59.760
The second manager appraises
woodwork and ornaments.

37:59.240 --> 38:02.460
[Third Manager of Taiyufeng]

38:00.110 --> 38:01.110
The third manager

38:01.150 --> 38:02.710
appraises rough furniture

38:02.880 --> 38:04.070
and daily items.

38:05.710 --> 38:08.880
This business is legal robbery.

38:08.960 --> 38:10.150
When you go to a pawnshop,

38:10.150 --> 38:11.840
even the finest goods

38:11.960 --> 38:12.920
fetch nothing but

38:12.920 --> 38:14.650
dirt-cheap prices.

38:14.710 --> 38:15.930
[Taiyufeng]

38:15.070 --> 38:18.000
But with interest added to those prices,

38:18.190 --> 38:20.590
you won't ever be able to
redeem your items.

38:22.690 --> 38:28.030
[Taiyufeng Record]

38:23.030 --> 38:25.490
The desperate pawn things for good.

38:26.030 --> 38:28.280
Those with hope pawn them
to get them back.

38:28.280 --> 38:29.840
Money comes and goes.

38:30.920 --> 38:32.070
People die,

38:32.670 --> 38:34.140
but money lives on.

38:36.550 --> 38:39.460
Pawnshops bring money in.

38:39.840 --> 38:42.250
Draft banks send money out.

38:42.630 --> 38:45.110
If skinning people and eating their flesh

38:45.190 --> 38:46.390
isn't enough for you,

38:47.030 --> 38:48.290
there are draft banks.

38:48.320 --> 38:50.970
They chew up the bones.

38:52.590 --> 38:54.150
Draft banks take deposits

38:54.550 --> 38:55.770
and issue loans.

38:56.400 --> 38:57.880
With just a few slips of paper,

38:57.880 --> 39:00.150
you can do business anywhere.

38:59.530 --> 39:03.470
[Taiyufeng]

39:01.190 --> 39:02.590
The silver, actually,

39:03.440 --> 39:05.760
never moves from the vault.

39:06.440 --> 39:08.030
This is the greatest business

39:08.030 --> 39:09.820
in the world.

39:12.670 --> 39:14.030
Do you understand?

39:14.710 --> 39:15.630
How am I supposed to understand

39:15.630 --> 39:16.830
from just a few words?

39:19.550 --> 39:22.070
I want to make a deal with you.

39:23.190 --> 39:24.440
Whatever is on your mind,

39:24.440 --> 39:25.970
you can tell me

39:26.000 --> 39:27.110
straight.

39:28.150 --> 39:29.590
A convict is a convict,

39:29.960 --> 39:32.550
but business is business.

39:41.400 --> 39:42.670
All these years,

39:43.440 --> 39:45.070
my pawnshop business

39:45.110 --> 39:47.190
has grown larger and larger.

39:48.150 --> 39:49.590
My subordinates think

39:50.230 --> 39:52.500
it's all their credit,

39:52.710 --> 39:53.670
as if everything

39:53.710 --> 39:55.170
came from their hard work.

39:55.230 --> 39:56.890
So why should the lion's share

39:56.960 --> 39:58.120
go to the master?

39:58.630 --> 39:59.230
Of course,

40:00.000 --> 40:01.480
that is human nature.

40:02.070 --> 40:03.480
But they are wrong.

40:04.070 --> 40:06.400
The master is the master.

40:07.670 --> 40:09.370
I cannot simply

40:09.400 --> 40:10.860
get rid of them overnight.

40:11.760 --> 40:14.270
That place is a stagnant pool.

40:14.490 --> 40:17.530
I need a shark like you

40:17.880 --> 40:19.760
to swim into that stagnant water,

40:19.800 --> 40:21.550
stir things up,

40:21.670 --> 40:23.960
and win back my control.

40:24.800 --> 40:25.510
Can you

40:25.880 --> 40:27.320
do that for me?

40:28.840 --> 40:29.900
When do I start?

40:47.080 --> 40:49.130
[Shixing Pawnshop]

40:57.600 --> 41:00.460
[Yixiu Shop]

41:06.190 --> 41:07.190
We're here.

41:17.940 --> 41:18.690
Guys!

41:18.590 --> 41:20.630
[Yixiu Shop]

41:19.000 --> 41:20.700
Set up the flags.

41:21.000 --> 41:22.690
Unload the silver carts.

41:23.070 --> 41:24.880
We are setting up our shop

41:25.000 --> 41:26.260
right here in Pingyao.

41:26.320 --> 41:27.000
-Yes.
-Yes.

41:27.370 --> 41:28.810
[Yixiu Shop]

41:29.110 --> 41:29.880
Patriarch!

41:36.760 --> 41:38.090
Where is the patriarch?

41:38.150 --> 41:39.750
Wang Tiangui is holding him.

41:40.670 --> 41:41.600
Wang Tiangui

41:41.670 --> 41:43.470
wants me to work in his pawnshop.

41:43.900 --> 41:44.760
Only if I do well

41:45.320 --> 41:46.780
will he release Mr. Chang.

41:49.110 --> 41:50.040
What do you mean?

41:51.230 --> 41:52.380
Anyway, for now,

41:52.400 --> 41:54.110
I'll sleep and eat at the pawnshop.

41:54.110 --> 41:55.170
When you have time,

41:55.230 --> 41:56.230
go look after him.

42:00.800 --> 42:02.200
Did I say you could leave?

42:03.320 --> 42:04.090
Gu Pingyuan.

42:08.030 --> 42:08.760
Mr. Gu.

42:10.040 --> 42:11.500
What about the patriarch?

42:11.920 --> 42:12.590
You know

42:12.710 --> 42:13.670
he is getting old.

42:13.670 --> 42:14.360
He can't survive

42:14.360 --> 42:16.090
the damp and cold of the prison.

42:17.590 --> 42:18.320
The house...

42:18.480 --> 42:19.700
w-we don't want it.

42:19.920 --> 42:20.360
Okay?

42:21.760 --> 42:23.190
We'll give all the money to Wang Tiangui.

42:23.190 --> 42:24.050
Is that enough?

42:24.550 --> 42:25.360
If money could solve this,

42:25.360 --> 42:26.290
it would be easy.

42:26.890 --> 42:28.360
Under the Law of the Qing Empire,

42:28.360 --> 42:30.510
harboring an exile
shares the exile's guilt.

42:30.510 --> 42:31.900
It's all your fault!

42:32.320 --> 42:32.960
Heizi!

42:33.070 --> 42:34.440
Heizi, what are you doing?

42:34.440 --> 42:35.430
Let go!

42:37.550 --> 42:38.320
Gu.

42:39.840 --> 42:41.150
What do we do now?

42:41.710 --> 42:43.310
We have to agree to his terms.

42:43.840 --> 42:44.700
Within a month,

42:45.070 --> 42:45.730
I must bring

42:45.730 --> 42:47.400
the head and second managers
under control.

42:47.400 --> 42:48.110
They are

42:48.130 --> 42:49.210
wily old foxes.

42:49.240 --> 42:50.790
How is a month enough?

42:57.550 --> 42:58.430
Gu.
